<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">The affirmative vote
of the holders of a majority of the shares represented at the Meeting and entitled to vote was required for approval. The proposal was
approved.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

